  ('Nord Coffee Identity', 'nord-coffee-identity', 'Branding', 2025, 'Nord Coffee', 'Brand Identity', 'Logo, packaging and a calm Nordic visual style for a speciality coffee brand.', 'The client had a great product but an outdated website that was slow on mobile and hard to update. Visitors left before they understood what the product did.', 'We rewrote the key messages, designed a clean mobile-first layout and built it with a fast, modern stack. A simple dashboard lets the team edit every section on their own.', 'Pages now load in under a second, bounce rate dropped by a third and the team publishes new content every week without a developer.', '/demo/pf-brand.svg', '["/demo/pf-brand.svg","/demo/pf-mobile.svg"]'::jsonb, null, 180, false, 'published', 3),
